'''Fangzhou''' is a mentioned city in [[Huanglong]]. Aside from [[Rongzhou]], whose only appearance is mistranslated as ''Shuzhou'', it is the only major Huanglong settlement to have its sole mention exist outside the game as of [[3.4]].

